<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Alfonso VIII</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Alfonso VIII was king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-castile">Castile</a> from 1158 to 1214. After being defeated by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almohad-caliphate">Almohads</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-alarcos">Alarcos</a> in 1195, he led a coalition of Christian kingdoms to a decisive victory at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-las-navas-de-tolosa">Las Navas de Tolosa</a> in 1212. That battle broke Almohad power in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iberia">Iberia</a> and accelerated the decline of the Almohad <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">Caliphate</a>.</p></div>
